{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity-extraction-check","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity-extraction-check","kind":"remark","title":"Bias correction applied to the extracted $\\hat c_2$ and $\\hat c_3$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity","tags":["q-beta","c-k-ladder","extraction","comparison-with-measurement"],"text":"q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity-extraction-check.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity-extraction-check\"></a><p>This remark records what the <a href=\"#prop:q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity\" data-at=\"mass-theory/mass-algebraic-qbeta-formalize-first-gates\">bias-correction identity</a> gives when applied to the coefficients extracted from data.</p>\n<p>The <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1.71\\%</code> relative bias on the extracted <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hat c_2</code> matches the structural signature <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_3^{\\mathrm{alg}} \\cdot u_0</code>. This agreement validates the generating-function hypothesis. Correcting <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hat c_3</code> yields <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-1.9999968</code>, consistent with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_3 = -2</code>. The proposition inverts the bias in closed form.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity-extraction-check.md","heading":"Remark","number":"13.9.22","page":"b/rem-q-beta-c-k-leading-bias-correction-identity-extraction-check"}
